OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday will remain dry with some
OL,6,Fpatchy cloud. It will feel cold with
OL,7,Fan east to southeasterly breeze and
OL,8,Ftemperatures just below average for
OL,9,Fthe time of year.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cold night to follow, with
OL,12,Fcloud to begin. Rain, perhaps falling
OL,13,Fas snow over higher ground for a time,
OL,14,Fand gusty winds move eastwards through
OL,15,Fthe region.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FWidespread rain through much
OL,18,Fof the day with some gusty winds at
OL,19,Ffirst. Rain, perhaps falling as snow
OL,20,Ffor a time over hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
